{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b42ae056-9dac-5389-bb7a-0526afdc9c98", "source_ordinal": 695, "reading_ordinal": 3362, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不解释", "published_at": "2025-07-03T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/085eaf8051fd11f0a32952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是对事情发生机制的错误描述。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "真正发生的是什么呢？", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是张三对你发起指控，你一旦向张三做起无罪自辩，你就在程序上自动认可了张三的审判权。而一切审判权都会自动包含自由裁量权，于是对你心怀恶意的张三就会滥用你亲自授予ta的自由裁量权判你有罪。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你的问题根本不在于你的自辩是否充足有效，而在于你出于无知，把一个敌人加封为了法官，然后为这个错误付出了代价。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一切在你把对方摆到法官位置上时已经被决定了，你之后的自我辩护对这位法官的职权没有决定作用。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“掩饰罪”只是这位法官决定判给你的罪名，而且ta判了就生效了，因为法官判案本来就没有“必须让被告服气”这个职业要求。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "下次记住——遇到任何人对你有质疑，就客客气气请对方向有关机关或负责人提出异议，你会向这些相关部门提交你的证据。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我尊重你的一切疑虑，但是凡事有规矩，我只能向有关部门提交资料，而不可能谁有疑问我就敞开隐私供人检查。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人要学会长大——别人其实没有什么“帮助你没有疙瘩的生活”的义务。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果你自己有疙瘩想不通，我可以介绍xx心理医生给你，或者建议你阅读素问参考源来解开心结。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "出于对你的爱，我就不用“暴露隐私帮你解开疙瘩”这种方式来帮你了，因为这只会帮你进一步养成错误的社会认知——其实没人会想给你这个解释的。你自己想不开是你自己要对自己承担的责任，怎么能你想不开别人就围着你忙来忙去呢？或者我忙来忙去然后开一张账单给你，你照单付账？", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这就是为什么你必须通过相关社会机构先成功立案，我再对来查案的专案组给出解释。如果你无法立案成功，那就只能你自己自我开导了。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "然后我必须友情提醒你一下——你对我有疙瘩，向有关部门寻求自我救济，截至这里，我们之间是没有问题的，我认为这是你应有的合法权利，并不认为这是一种敌对行为。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但如果你没有立案成功，或者立案成功没有得出判决，或者得出结果并不支持你的主张，而你要在这个前提下对我采取实质性的攻击行动——这包括但不限于直接言语攻击或动手妨碍我的合法利益——例如我的名誉权，那么这就过线了。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 838}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我就不能不把这种行为视为针对我个人的敌对行为，是宣战而且邀战。那样我就只好把你列为我的打击目标。", "char_start": 839, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我不想这样（拉开衣服下摆，给你看看挂在腰带上的耳朵干），因为如果我成为你的敌人，你的人生体验和生活质量可能会有些轻微的不愉快。", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 951}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我很遗憾你有这些疙瘩，也很抱歉无法通过敞开隐私给你检查的方式来解除你的纠结和怀疑，我不反对你采用合法手段向相关部门或主管寻求帮助并衷心祝你好运。", "char_start": 952, "char_end": 1024}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "现在，如果你没有别的什么事，请原谅我必须继续忙我手头的事了。", "char_start": 1025, "char_end": 1055}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "Have a nice day.", "char_start": 1056, "char_end": 1072}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么理解“解释就是掩饰，掩饰就是事实”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“不解释”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是对事情发生机制的错误描述。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是对事情发生机制的错误描述。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "01a2b7b6-a5cf-59a1-98a4-eff43456670c", "source_ordinal": 694, "reading_ordinal": 3363, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "学股神", "published_at": "2025-07-03T11:29:17.402000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1908776535424505454/answer/1923894947452523407"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "世界上哪有智商高到能在股市上不失手的人？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "光是把“股市失手”归因于“智商”，这个行为本身就和“智商高”有逻辑矛盾了。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "股市在原则上就是不可预测的，你选错了也谈不上什么愚蠢。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这整个心态都要不得。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有这种“我能猜透股市走向”的心态，是最容易“死不认输”然后被生吞活剥的，因为你很容易来个“别慌，都是技术性调整”。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "另外学历高并不能确切的证明做事的能力，它更多的说明的其实不是智商，而是适应学校教育规则的社会性能力。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "同样的教师指导，对你不容易产生对别人的那种负面刺激；同样的课堂纪律，对你不容易产生对别人的那种压抑感。所以你得以比较专心稳定的专注学业，并且你的智商也没有成为瓶颈，于是你学历就高起来了。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "问题是，社会通行的社交规则和学校其实不是同一个风格，而是千奇百怪。你能在学校环境下如鱼得水，并不能真的保证你在企业、市场、股市里也能乘风破浪。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而这本来不是一个很大的问题——你不会，别人其实也不会。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "问题恰恰在于你出于自己在学校环境下的优良表现不假思索的断言你在其他环境下也必然出色。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这就会导致其它环境给了你负面信号，你也往往因为对自己能力的过度自信拒绝接收。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这会带来很多教训。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "受了教训，承认自己什么也不懂，然后扮演好新的小学生再出发也可以——事实上别人也多少要受同样的教训，也是要重新出发的。", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 551}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "真正的问题恰恰是这个时候才出现——别人吃了新环境的教训后重新出发了，你却会在这时质问“我智商高怎么会失败，问题出在哪里”。", "char_start": 552, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "恰恰是这份恋栈不去的傲慢，才开始拉开你与已经重新出发的人的距离。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "股市并不认学历，老老实实从头开始吧。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 665}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：学历很高，但是进入股市后，发现智商不够乃至非常愚蠢导致屡屡出错，是什么原因？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“学股神”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“世界上哪有智商高到能在股市上不失手的人？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "世界上哪有智商高到能在股市上不失手的人？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7aa6e7e3-3ba4-5e06-acb4-2faff3d5d0d1", "source_ordinal": 693, "reading_ordinal": 3364, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "正果", "published_at": "2025-07-03T16:00:10.816000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1917959834797581894/answer/1924134919669548311"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "中国的朝代兴替有一个很有特色的现象，就是“安乐公”现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "新朝替代旧朝，会非常执着的接受前朝末帝的投降，给予一个公、侯爵位，令其终老天年。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为最后一个皇帝正式投降退位，并且接受新朝爵位，就可以彻底杜绝前朝的忠臣义士另外推举王室血脉，在南方、巴蜀甚至海外之地复国继统、做长期对抗。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "譬如崇祯帝自尽不降，就导致清王朝直到康熙六十年还在和“朱三太子”们缠斗。这还没算台湾“国姓爷”势力。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "又比如明建文帝在朱棣入京后失踪，搞到朱棣追查下落一辈子。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这说明的是什么呢？", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "就是要统治中国而要成本低，必须得国以正。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不是一个“占领全境 / 首都”的军事现状就可以宣告胜利了。如果你得国不正，如此辽阔浩渺的帝国，百族杂生，山川形胜之地不可胜数，你将会面对此起彼伏、永无宁日的割据叛乱。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而得国欲正，得国的手段就必须有规矩、有大义。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "否则人心不服，祸患无穷。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不靠暗杀而能驱寇虏、御外辱，以极弱代极强，华夏垂两千年来从无如我朝得国之正者。", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "当心那些跟你做你死我活的斗争而不用暗杀手段的对手，那都是对“我们必须考虑将来怎么坐天下”已经胸有成竹的人。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "只要ta们还没开始动暗杀手段，就意味着ta们对结果的确信没有发生动摇。如果你不能不承认这些人不是傻瓜，你就绝不能对这些人的成算掉以轻心。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 539}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么我党不采取暗杀？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“正果”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“中国的朝代兴替有一个很有特色的现象，就是“安乐公”现象。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "中国的朝代兴替有一个很有特色的现象，就是“安乐公”现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6af10195-d54a-5e56-9aaf-42b2139eda09", "source_ordinal": 692, "reading_ordinal": 3365, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "man of words", "published_at": "2025-07-03T17:11:29.506000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1910865073422964722/answer/1923544597302317253"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个极大的误会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "谁说我不怕？", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我怕得要死。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但我是军人，轮到我上，职责所在，我没资格怕。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我不能吃一辈子军粮，到了该我上的时候谈“我怕”。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人总要讲良心、讲信用、讲公平。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我根本不是因为“不怕”而冲上去，仅仅是因为“人要讲信用”而已。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "对别人要讲信用，对自己也要讲信用。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我参军、我考警校、我谈恋爱、我签合同的时候，已经把“怕”这个字签出去了。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "事到临头，我没资格怕，我要讲信用。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "A man is only as good as his words.", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "The Power of a Man’s Word", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "That’s why when a man talks, people listen.", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你需要的不是勇气，而是把自己当个值得别人严肃对待的人。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "没人严肃对待的人，活着也与死无异。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 344}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男儿如何有胆气?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“man of words”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个极大的误会。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个极大的误会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8e93e95e-7930-5af0-a2e8-0865912a69fc", "source_ordinal": 691, "reading_ordinal": 3366, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无痕", "published_at": "2025-07-04T01:59:47.875000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/595963208/answer/1924269490075567123"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不要把这种事看得多重。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "没有得病、没有受伤、没有犯什么罪，那就只不过水过无痕，water under the bridge。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "Just let it go.", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“把什么样的尺度的事当作值得纠结的事”是一种度量单位。因为你能筹谋、追求、掌控的事的规模上限和这个“最小介意尺度”是正相关的。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个尺度的事就让你烦恼不已、无法释怀，你真正需要在意的不是“这个男人到底喜欢谁”，而是你的命到底有几两重。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你将来要纵横天下，不知还要结交多少英雄豪杰，有多少风流韵事。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你注定会是很多人的爱情神话，刻在不知多少人的终身遗憾里，到死都念念不忘。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这点插曲甚至都不值得你记住，这个人的名字再过两年你要是还记得，你都应该觉得羞耻——那说明你太不上进了。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "实际上你现在在纠结，本身就意味着你把自己没当成一个值得珍惜的人看。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "把这人抛在后视镜里，踩死你的油门扬长而去，让他将来听着你的传说纠结去。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你如果对得起你自己，他将来是不会留在你的记忆中的。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "人自轻自贱，其实不是从被人打骂侮辱而忍气吞声开始的。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人自轻自贱，是从纠结微不足道的损失开始的。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "麻烦有点出息。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 469}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：跟男同事睡过之后，他在朋友圈官宣了，我要怎么掩饰自己的情绪？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“无痕”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不要把这种事看得多重。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不要把这种事看得多重。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "40931765-4b99-5992-8e91-eda782abb3d4", "source_ordinal": 690, "reading_ordinal": 3367, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "明日之子", "published_at": "2025-07-04T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/7d72683a52bf11f092dc52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "那么，本该诞生的新的自我怎么办呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人要在意的，永远不是“旧我如何不死去”，而是“新我如何能出生”。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "旧我的存在，只是为了为新我积攒“遗产”，帮助新我在更高的台阶上继续前进。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "旧我的死亡是时间已经替你决定的，是你无法阻止和更改的，即使你以“今日新生之我与昨日死去之我毫无二致”来抗议时间之神的无情，你也只是在自我欺骗——因为你的新我的可延续期和那个旧我不同，少了一天。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "即使一切都相同，新我也比旧我少了一天。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一天又一天，内容完全没变，只是可延续期少了两年、三年，单单这一个要素，就能在某个时刻让你竭力维持的不变自我崩塌——就像越来越细的柱子无法再支撑同样的房顶一样。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你必须变轻。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "必须飞起来。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是时间的命令。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "旧我不必你杀，昨天ta已经死了。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你是在今天早上重新出生的。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "ta给了你遗产，正如你今天要再加上你的份，交给明天的你一样。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“为了明天的你度过今天”，昨天的你一定会这样对你说。", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "明天的你对你最重要。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "今天闭上眼之前，想想你在明天的新生儿枕边留了什么礼物。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 435}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我总觉得「改变自我等于杀死现在的我」所以恐惧自己的变化，该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“明日之子”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“那么，本该诞生的新的自我怎么办呢？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "那么，本该诞生的新的自我怎么办呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "47408416-6762-551c-bfdf-362c2c89812a", "source_ordinal": 689, "reading_ordinal": 3368, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小猫游戏", "published_at": "2025-07-05T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/2b812890538711f0b9975254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然没道理。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为他没有给出“有能力”的鉴定方法，因此这个回复你其实没有办法执行。没有办法执行的解决方案，自然也就谈不上合理了。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "事实是你根本没办法不去思考这些问题，这是一个人构建自己价值观的本能发育过程。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你必须形成一个对一切事物估计价值高低、意义大小的方法，然后才能用这个方法来决定哪些事先做、哪些事后做，能花多少成本、能期待什么收益。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果没有这个估价的方法，你就很难构建起自己的快感反馈机制，导致的结果就是你其实不知道为什么要做这件事，而这件事又为什么要下这么大的本钱、做到这个程度。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为缺少这个总体估价的能力，你的价值观就会自然而然的退化成“能让管理员夸我 / 放过我的就是好的”。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这就像分拣零件的鸽子，其实并不理解自己为什么要分拣零件，只知道这样做就有人喂自己谷子、那样做就没有。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我这样做，不是因为我觉得有价值，不是因为我相信社会、市场觉得这个有价值，而是因为我相信张三觉得有价值。我做了，不是我自己感到满足、不是社会和市场给我良性反馈而感到满足，是因为张三给我报酬——或张三会高抬贵手不惩罚我——而感到满足。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "于是一切都着落在了张三身上。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "问题是，张三会撒谎、张三可能赖账、张三可能破产失去支付能力、张三可能会离开、会死。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我对张三的支付信用、支付能力的信心也可能产生动摇。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 547}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "很多人之所以弃学、自闭，其实就是这个原因——我读书不是因为我觉得读书好，而是因为“我不读你要折磨我，我读好了你会夸我奖励我”。", "char_start": 548, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而一旦我跟你的关系变坏，我就会对你的所谓夸奖失去感受；一旦我觉得真的很累，就会觉得你的奖励并不值得。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "尤其是，我发现你多次不兑现奖励承诺，而且渐渐的喜欢用“免于批评”这种“零成本”的手段来维持你的价值观对我的有效性，我这个“张三觉得好就好”的价值观逻辑就会崩溃。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "崩溃了，我就一下子不知道哪件事最值钱、应该最优先了。", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一旦茫然无措，人就会自动进入“不盲动”的节能模式——就像一个人突然发现迷路了，立刻就会本能的先停止前进一样。万一我方向走反了，我还努力往前走，岂不是反而越错越远、死得越快？", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以，当子女开始思考国家、社会、世界、政治等等这些价值观问题的时候，父母的恰当态度绝不应该是去打击、惩罚、遏止，而应该着手把这个探讨作为一种“奖励”。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 933}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你及时做好了作业，质量不错，那我们就来聊一聊最近的社会新闻，谈一谈你最近的奇思妙想。", "char_start": 934, "char_end": 976}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这种对话不能是“用我的观点驳倒你的观点”，或者用来“揭露你有多幼稚”，而应该是立场可以随时调转的、苏格拉底式的政论游戏。", "char_start": 977, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你问我为什么人类不能直接把七十岁以上的住院老人都直接安乐死，这个想法挺有意思，你作业写好了没有？写好了我们先把历史上曾经这么主张过的名人找出来看看。我们先看看那些古人怎么辩论这个话题的。然后我们再站在不同的立场尝试支持和反对这些历史对话中的看法。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1161}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不要害怕这些议题，你放心，这些议题全部都在这几千年里被无数人翻来覆去的争论过，各种不同的答案都被某人实践过、测试过。", "char_start": 1162, "char_end": 1220}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "光是循着ta那些稀奇古怪的问题，父子、母女一起追溯古今，然后互相研讨，本身就是非常积极的亲情享乐。", "char_start": 1221, "char_end": 1270}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "结论其实根本不重要，就像小猫追打嬉戏胜负根本不重要一样。小猫会在这不分胜负的追打嬉戏里快乐的长肌肉、学身手，这才是正常的发展路线。", "char_start": 1271, "char_end": 1336}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "父母不必焦虑子女一时间开玩笑似的持有某种骇人听闻的“暴论”，因为游戏又没有结束可言，可以挑战这些“暴论”的依据明天后天还会冒出来。暴论之所以是暴论，不就是因为有更多更硬的东西能击败它吗？", "char_start": 1337, "char_end": 1430}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "真正重要的，是把这种探讨变成子女喜爱的、期待的家庭游戏，是在这游戏里加强家人间的彼此理解和羁绊。", "char_start": 1431, "char_end": 1479}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你放心，随ta多吓人的怪论，天天陪ta玩得开心的朋友说不要，对ta的效力就足够了。", "char_start": 1480, "char_end": 1521}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这个小游戏如果成为家庭传统，在无数的“并肩作战”中子女了解了你这个战友的能力和信用，那么ta以后有什么想法都会先来看看你怎么想。", "char_start": 1522, "char_end": 1586}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "其实你们仔细想想，为什么你们就算未必同意我的全部看法，有问题却还是愿意问我的看法？不正是因为这几千篇建立起来的信用吗？", "char_start": 1587, "char_end": 1646}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "素问的存在本身就是这个方法有效的证明，不是吗？", "char_start": 1647, "char_end": 1670}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "ta有想法，你能拥有这一次有效的发言机会，这就是你可以指望的最大的努力余地了。", "char_start": 1671, "char_end": 1710}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "其它就要看天了。", "char_start": 1711, "char_end": 1719}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我跟父亲提出了一些对人生意义和社会现象的看法。他却回复我“等你有能力时再去思考这些。”他说的有道理吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“小猫游戏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然没道理。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然没道理。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "aaf212b3-d25e-50e9-9634-af72e4d341e6", "source_ordinal": 688, "reading_ordinal": 3369, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "背水人", "published_at": "2025-07-05T15:03:14.859000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/491100733/answer/1924844940137070827"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "晒太阳算不算不劳而获？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你躺在草地上，动都没动，冬天的阳光就给你晒得全身暖洋洋的。你还翻了个身，晒至两面金黄。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "坐阳台上吹风算不算不劳而获？你坐在摇椅上晃晃悠悠，清风拂面，清凉胜境，何其快哉。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你付出了多少劳动？获了多少益？", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "走出门躺在草地上、拿罐可乐坐在躺椅上算不算劳动？", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "劳动本身到底是一个什么样的行为？", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "劳动本质上是一个摘果子、挖矿式的行为。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "果子是树上自己长的，果树承担了绝大多数的“工作量”，你的劳动只是伸手扯断果蒂。矿是这个宇宙花了几十上百亿年孕育的，你的劳动是拿铲子把它挖出来，用水把它洗净。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "同理，人的分享欲是自然花了几百万年通过残酷的自然原则、社会竞争塑造成的，你的提问只是触发人的本能机制而收取收益的过程。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个过程和蚂蚁刺激蚜虫吐蜜其实没有什么本质分别。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "并不因为果子是树结的、矿是宇宙孕育的，摘果子、挖矿就不再是劳动，所以，并不因为问题是对方答的，提问就不算劳动。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "提问获得解答，不算不劳而获。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但这不该是你从这个答案里得到的最大的教益。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你更应该看到的，是劳动本质上是一种多么一本万利的获利行为。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只要你懂得看清资源流动的规律和富集的逻辑，它根本就不是一种“苦役”，而是一种转转帆的方向就可以免费乘风航行千里的“四两拨千斤”的行为。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "是一种张开衣兜天上就有果子掉下来填满口袋的行为。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "世间万物，自然已经造好了，你要做的工作仅仅只是全部工作量之中堪称微不足道的部分，大概只相当于“拧开水龙头”。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 609}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你只是需要知道水龙头在哪、要往哪拧。", "char_start": 610, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "真正“辛苦”的根本不是“拧水龙头”，而是“寻找水龙头”。", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "向正确的人问正确的提问，你就可以得到金钱无法衡量的价值、其它物种花了几亿年也无法企及的宝藏，而且还常常是免费的。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "真正要艰苦努力的，不是去张嘴说咒语，而是学会谁是正确的人、什么是正确的问题。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 753}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "不要搞错了方向。", "char_start": 754, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "搞对方向的人，三铲子挖出永不枯竭的泉水。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 783}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "搞错方向的人，每天走十里背水上山。", "char_start": 784, "char_end": 801}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0484"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「请教」本身算不算是一种不劳而获的行为？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“背水人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“晒太阳算不算不劳而获？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "晒太阳算不算不劳而获？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
